>
    <Section level={3} title="Replay a quarter week by week">
        <p>One clock moves <code>at</code> while <code>playing</code>, each frame by the time
            passed times <code>rate</code>. Its parts are made of public ones: <code>play</code>
            is a <code>toggle</code>'s button, <code>speed</code> a <code>toggleGroup</code> over
            the rates, and the keys on <code>root</code> are <code>hotkeys</code> — Space plays
            and pauses, the arrows step it. <code>scrubber</code> goes on an
            <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>.</p>
        <Example code={replayQuarter}><ReplayQuarter /></Example>
    </Section>

    <Section level={3} title="Animate two things at their own lengths from one play button">
        <p>Make a <code>playback</code> per thing that moves and hand them all one
            <code>playing</code>. Each keeps its own <code>at</code>, <code>duration</code> and
            <code>loop</code>, and one press plays them all. The first to reach its end without
            <code>loop</code> writes <code>playing</code> false, pausing the rest.</p>
        <Example code={weeksAndBeat}><WeeksAndBeat /></Example>
    </Section>
</Doc>
